{"type": "message", "id": "04fd1c7e", "parentId": "5f228676", "timestamp": "2026-04-04T11:16:47.821Z", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_xlKogIVEmvSRL1qDBLJa20fb", "toolName": "web_search", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\n  \"query\": \"Kentucky average score Grade 8 mathematics 2022 NAEP Kentucky 2022 grade 8 math average score\",\n  \"provider\": \"brave\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"tookMs\": 1024,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"brave\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"71661225568d007e\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n2022 MATHEMATICS STATE SNAPSHOT REPORT KENTUCKY  GRADE 8  PUBLIC SCHOOLS\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"71661225568d007e\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://nces.ed.gov/nationsreportcard/subject/publications/stt2022/pdf/2023011KY8.pdf\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"83ff39973d9e2ef1\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nAVERAGE SCORES FOR STATE/JURISDICTION AND THE NATION (PUBLIC) ... White students. This performance gap was not significantly different from that in 2000 ... NOTE: The NAEP mathematics scale ranges from <strong>0 to 500</strong>. Results presented in this report are based on public school students only.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"83ff39973d9e2ef1\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"nces.ed.gov\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"130ffc1f84a9960c\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nNAEP Mathematics: State Average Scores\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"130ffc1f84a9960c\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.nationsreportcard.gov/mathematics/states/scores/?grade=8\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7905270c0c8cd10a\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n... In the 43 states/jurisdictions where scores were lower i